course: dictionary
lesson: 1725
title: Citron: fruit or lemon?
level: primary-5
stars: 2
explain: A citron is a large fruit that looks a bit like a lemon, but it is much bigger and has a very thick, bumpy rind (the skin). People often candy it, which means cooking it in sugar, and then put it in cakes. «Candied citron peel» is a phrase you might find in a cake recipe.
explain: In French, citron means lemon. Context tells you which meaning to use. «Une limonade» is fizzy lemonade, like Sprite, and «un citron pressé» is fresh squeezed lemon with water and sugar. In a French drinks menu, citron means lemon, not the big fruit.
explain: Ask yourself what would fit. In a cake recipe, citron means the big bumpy fruit. In a French shop, citron can be a flavour. «Quel parfum ?» means «Which flavour?», and parfum here means flavour, not perfume. Common flavours are vanille, chocolat, fraise and citron.
fact: A citron is a large citrus fruit with a very thick, bumpy rind.
fact: «Candied citron peel» means citron peel cooked in sugar, often used in cakes.
fact: «Citron» means «lemon» in French.
fact: «Un citron pressé» means a fresh squeezed lemon drink, with water and sugar.
fact: «Parfum» means both perfume and flavour, so check the context.
exercise: «Candied citron peel» is used in a cake. What is the citron here? | * A large, bumpy citrus fruit | A type of ice cream | A small green sweet | A fizzy lemon drink
exercise: On a French menu you see «un citron pressé». What is it? | A fizzy lemonade like Sprite | A bottle of perfume | An ice cream | * A fresh squeezed lemon drink with water and sugar
exercise: At an ice cream shop, the sign says «Quel parfum ?» and lists vanille, chocolat, fraise and citron. What does citron mean in this list? | Strawberry | Perfume | Chocolate | * Lemon flavour
test: In «Quel parfum ?», what does parfum mean here? | * Flavour | Lemon | Ice cream | Perfume
test: Which French word means lemon? | Parfum | Glace | * Citron | Limonade
exam: In a cake recipe citron means the fruit, but in a French drinks list «citron» means what? | Water with sugar only | * Lemon | Orange juice | Fizzy lemonade like Sprite
